# Binary assets: mark so git applies no text/EOL filters and treats them as
# non-diffable blobs. Mirrors apps/portfolio/.gitattributes (M8-03). Per
# CLAUDE.md's source-byte-law carve-out, a path declared `binary` here is exempt
